  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Next\n\nFirst release. Runs code rules as xUnit v3 tests.\n\n- A source generator (inside the package) reads the `ICodeRuleSetup` and writes one test per registered rule, one class per group, with the category traits `CodeRules`, `CodeRules <Group>` and `CodeRules <Tag>`.\n- Skipped rules show up as skipped tests with their reason; a guard test fails when a registered rule has no generated test.\n- Build warnings `CODERULE_GEN_0001`-`0003` for a missing or duplicate setup and registrations the generator cannot read.\n- Human or AI failure output (`UseOutputMode`, `CodeRuleSettings__OutputMode`).\n- Marks the project as a code rule project (`IsCodeRuleProject`), so the `coderules` CLI runs the same rules.",
